(>> 6.2 Euler's Formulae for Fourier Coefficients) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Fourier Series Representation in Interval \(-pi, pi\):) Tj
T*
(f\(x\) = a0 / 2 + sum_{n=1}^inf [ an * cos\(nx\) + bn * sin\(nx\) ].) Tj
T*
(* Euler's Formulae:) Tj
T*
(a0 = \(1 / pi\) * int_{-pi}^{pi} f\(x\) dx.) Tj
T*
(an = \(1 / pi\) * int_{-pi}^{pi} f\(x\) * cos\(nx\) dx \(for n = 1, 2, 3, ...\).) Tj
T*
(bn = \(1 / pi\) * int_{-pi}^{pi} f\(x\) * sin\(nx\) dx \(for n = 1, 2, 3, ...\).) Tj
T*
(* Fourier Series for Arbitrary Period T = 2L \(Interval -L to L\):) Tj
T*
(f\(x\) = a0 / 2 + sum_{n=1}^inf [ an * cos\(n*pi*x / L\) + bn * sin\(n*pi*x / L\) ], where:) Tj
T*
(a0 = \(1 / L\) * int_{-L}^L f\(x\) dx.) Tj
T*
(an = \(1 / L\) * int_{-L}^L f\(x\) * cos\(n*pi*x / L\) dx.) Tj
T*
(bn = \(1 / L\) * int_{-L}^L f\(x\) * sin\(n*pi*x / L\) dx.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
