/F2 9.5 Tf
(>> 6.3 Even and Odd Functions \(Half-Range Expansions\)) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Even Functions \(f\(-x\) = f\(x\), symmetric about y-axis\):) Tj
T*
(Product f\(x\)*sin\(nx\) is odd => bn = 0 \(No sine terms\).) Tj
T*
(Fourier Cosine Series: a0 = \(2 / L\) * int_0^L f\(x\) dx; an = \(2 / L\) * int_0^L) Tj
T*
(f\(x\)*cos\(n*pi*x / L\) dx.) Tj
T*
(* Odd Functions \(f\(-x\) = -f\(x\), symmetric about origin\):) Tj
T*
(f\(x\) and f\(x\)*cos\(nx\) are odd => a0 = 0 and an = 0 \(No cosine terms\).) Tj
T*
(Fourier Sine Series: bn = \(2 / L\) * int_0^L f\(x\)*sin\(n*pi*x / L\) dx.) Tj
T*
(* Half-Range Series: A function defined only on interval \(0, L\) can be expanded into) Tj
T*
(either:) Tj
