(Solution Step 2: Compute a0:) Tj
T*
(a0 = \(2 / pi\) * int_0^pi \(pi*x - x^2\) dx = \(2 / pi\) * [ pi*x^2/2 - x^3/3 ]_0^pi) Tj
T*
(a0 = \(2 / pi\) * [ pi^3/2 - pi^3/3 ] = \(2 / pi\) * \(pi^3 / 6\) = pi^2 / 3.) Tj
T*
(Constant term: a0 / 2 = pi^2 / 6.) Tj
T*
(Solution Step 3: Compute an using integration by parts:) Tj
T*
(an = \(2 / pi\) * int_0^pi \(pi*x - x^2\) * cos\(nx\) dx.) Tj
T*
(Using generalized formula \(u = pi*x - x^2, u' = pi - 2x, u'' = -2\):) Tj
T*
(an = \(2 / pi\) * [ \(pi*x - x^2\)*\(sin\(nx\)/n\) - \(pi - 2x\)*\(-cos\(nx\)/n^2\) +) Tj
T*
(\(-2\)*\(-sin\(nx\)/n^3\) ]_0^pi.) Tj
T*
(Evaluating at 0 and pi \(sin terms vanish\):) Tj
T*
(At x = pi: - \(pi - 2*pi\)*\(-cos\(n*pi\)/n^2\) = - \(-pi\)*\(-\(-1\)^n / n^2\) = - pi*\(-1\)^n / n^2.) Tj
T*
(At x = 0: - \(pi - 0\)*\(-cos\(0\)/n^2\) = - pi*\(-1/n^2\) = + pi / n^2.) Tj
T*
(an = \(2 / pi\) * [ - pi*\(-1\)^n / n^2 - pi / n^2 ] = - \(2 / n^2\) * [ 1 + \(-1\)^n ].) Tj
T*
(- If n is ODD: 1 + \(-1\)^n = 1 - 1 = 0 => an = 0.) Tj
T*
(- If n is EVEN: 1 + \(-1\)^n = 2 => an = - 4 / n^2. Let n = 2m: a_{2m} = - 4 /) Tj
T*
(\(2m\)^2 = - 1 / m^2.) Tj
T*
(Solution Step 4: Write Half-Range Cosine Series:) Tj
T*
(pi*x - x^2 = pi^2 / 6 - sum_{m=1}^inf [ \(1 / m^2\) * cos\(2mx\) ]) Tj
T*
(pi*x - x^2 = pi^2 / 6 - [ cos\(2x\)/1^2 + cos\(4x\)/2^2 + cos\(6x\)/3^2 + ... ].) Tj
